        "expression": "let density = (180.0 + wave_height * 900.0) / grain_size;\nlet cell = floor(p * density);\nlet tick = floor(t * (10.0 + line_speed * 18.0));\nlet speck = hash(cell + vec2<f32>(tick * 17.13, tick * 29.71));\nlet shaped = clamp((speck - 0.5) * static_contrast + 0.5, 0.0, 1.0);\nlet lane = hash(cell + vec2<f32>(5.17, 83.91));\nlet tint = mix(c2, c1, lane);\nlet lo = c4 * 0.35;\nlet hi = mix(c5, tint, 0.16 + 0.14 * lane);\nlet grain = mix(lo, hi, shaped);\nlet flashes = mix(c3, c1, lane) * smoothstep(0.88, 0.99, speck) * 0.26;\nlet color = tonemap(grain * 1.25 + flashes);\nreturn mix(bg, color, strength);",
